Items discussed: Standards inactivity, non-posting of TC Basis,comp.lang.forth
                 on Usenet,infant ForthNet on GEnie/well/xCFB,FIG-L on BitNet,
                 new Denver Forth BBS,JFAR,Issy and REPTL,Block vs Text.
                 GEnie Forth RT short term Guest conference line-up=round 2 of
                 Mitch Bradley, Larry Forsley and {maybe} C.H.Ting
           
